"4. On Permissions, tick account_info.read, files.content.write and "
"sharing.write, then press Submit.\n"
"5. On Settings, under OAuth 2, add the redirect URI {uri} and press Add.\n"
"6. Copy the App key into the field above.\n"
"Development status is enough. Leave the field empty to use this build’s own "
"key, if it has one."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox 需要注册一个属于你的应用：\n"
"1. 在 dropbox.com/developers/apps 上点击 Create app。\n"
"2. 选择 Scoped access，然后选择 App folder 或 Full Dropbox。\n"
"3. 取一个没人用过的名称，然后点击 Create app。\n"
"4. 在 Permissions 中勾选 account_info.read、files.content.write 和 "
"sharing.write，然后点击 Submit。\n"
"5. 在 Settings 的 OAuth 2 下，添加重定向 URI {uri} 并点击 Add。\n"
"6. 将 App key 复制到上面的字段中。\n"
"开发状态就足够了。留空该字段可使用此版本自带的密钥（如果有）。"

